    "sections": {
        "description": "Ariade is a WCAG 2.2 AA compliant Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress block theme for accessible professional-services and business websites. It ships with accessible header navigation, screen-reader-tested block patterns and predesigned inner pages. The free Ariade Header and Menu plugin adds the theme's simple, WCAG-friendly drop-down menu header, and the Ananyoo accessibility plugins add a carousel, forms and login. Built by M/S. Anblik."
    },
